    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't like visual novels? This game is for you!\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</strong> <br><strong>Connoisseur of the genre? Even more so!</strong> <br><strong>\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566880/extras/cc0768161fa713fe8468132d16c2b129.poster.avif?t=1743706305\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566880/extras/cc0768161fa713fe8468132d16c2b129.webm?t=1743706305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566880/extras/cc0768161fa713fe8468132d16c2b129.mp4?t=1743706305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MOOD</strong> is a gloomy, philosophically-walking visual novel beyond it's genre. The player will meet a girl and take a walk with her through the backstreets of a decaying city. Ask the right questions, listen to your interlocutor and find the truth in the dialogues. Nothing bad will happen, we <strong>promise</strong>.\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<strong>\u2800\u2593\u2593</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u2800\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERY CHOICE IS WRONG.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game doesn't have \u201cright\u201d endings or choices. A good intention can turn out to be a <strong>bad</strong> one in the future, just as a bad deed can turn out to be the <strong>safest</strong>. Make choices with your heart, show <strong>her</strong> the real you.<strong>\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2800\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</strong> <br>Did we mention that every choice affects the environment? Oops\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566880/extras/d2ad04468bfd9d2fe4a51410895affdb.poster.avif?t=1743706305\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566880/extras/d2ad04468bfd9d2fe4a51410895affdb.webm?t=1743706305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566880/extras/d2ad04468bfd9d2fe4a51410895affdb.mp4?t=1743706305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GLOOMY SURROUNDINGS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clouds overhead and dirty snow underfoot. The game's locations reflect the realities of provincial post-CIS cities. Our story begins in one of them. Not the most cheerful landscape, is it? <br><strong>Every</strong> scene is inspired by real-life streets.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique visual style done in the \u201cdirty\u201d shades of a winter city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholic and gloomy soundtrack, in the genres of Dark Ambient, Post-punk and Witch House. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4k</strong> artwork with incredible detail. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations tell their <strong>own story</strong> and immerse you in the LORE, just look closely. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An environment that changes depending on hidden scale.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of undertone for the riddle enjoyers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong><u>content</u></strong> on re-runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can steal beer and smoke cigarettes! Lots of cigarettes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art. No AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566880/extras/9ad92b91c9712a9c8e68435d43a58288.avif?t=1743706305\" width=640 height=150 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is not recommended for those under the age of 20.</strong></p></li></ul>",
